# Bulk figure harvest pool and the published-figure ledger produced by
# scripts/lib/figure-bulk.js and scripts/build-figure-pages.js. Without these
# two, a fresh clone has no candidates and no memory of which file was already
# published, so every rebuild re-publishes the same photographs on other topics'
# pages and the figure count never grows past one run's harvest.
!data/figure-candidates.json
!data/figure-published.json
# Coverage audit, written by scripts/build-figure-coverage.js. Committed so the
# gap report is reviewable in history and diffable between runs, which is the
# only way to tell progress on coverage from a rerun that changed nothing.
!data/figure-coverage.json
